flowchart LR
  B[Browser] -->|HTTP| A[Apache]
  A --> R[Root .htaccess: block internal folders]
  A --> P[public/.htaccess]
  P -->|file or directory exists| S[Serve static asset]
  P -->|other path| F[public/index.php]
  F --> L[Load app config, autoload, session, exception handler]
  F --> W[routes/web.php + Router]
  W --> C[Controller action]
  C --> M[Model]
  M --> D[Database::connection / PDO]
  D --> DB[(MySQL schema)]
  C --> V[View::render]
  V --> T[PHP view + customer layout]
  T -->|HTML| B
  C -->|Redirect / status| B
